id: massive-blow
name: Massive Blow
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: true
requiresTarget: true
usageLimit: 1/round
# KP Cost: 5(T) over its Profile's - the table's to add as it is declared.
# Opened while its Awakening applies (allow maneuver.<id>); a Special Maneuver, not a Villainous one - those every Adversary has.
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  You destroy everything.
text: >
  Massive Blow [1/Round]: You destroy everything.
  –Maneuver Type: Standard Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –KP Cost: 5(T) higher than the Ki Point Cost of your chosen Profile
  –Exploitable: All Adjacent Opponents. If you take Damage from an Attacking Maneuver made through the Exploit Maneuver in response to this Attacking Maneuver, the Maneuver fails.
  –Effect: Make an Attacking Maneuver of any Profile. That Attacking Maneuver gains a Destructive AoE of your choice. After concluding that Attacking Maneuver, all squares within that AoE gain the Desolated Environmental Quality for 2 Combat Rounds.

---

# Exploitable: whoever may Exploit it, and that a Damage taken from it makes it fail - the table's, as every Exploit is called.
# An Attacking Maneuver of any Profile with a Destructive AoE of your choice (asked as it is declared); the Squares it covers Desolated
# for 2 Combat Rounds afterwards: the table's (traits/qualities/desolated.dbu says what it does).
[automatic/declare-maneuver]
requires using("massive-blow");
allow area.destructiveAdded;
